cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DNSsifter or the CDRI data in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "DNSsifter"
abstract: >-
  DNSsifter is a multithreaded, recursive DNS enumeration and measurement toolkit
  with customized English, Arabic, and Arabizi wordlists, wildcard-aware probing,
  trusted-resolver confirmation, and a reproducible Composite DNS Resilience Index
  (CDRI) scoring pipeline.
type: software
